# APP-SPLIT-003E — gates log (2026-11-26)

Lane: pure-move extraction of the practice wiring slice from App() into
apps/desktop/src/app/practice-wiring.ts (runOpenPractice +
runChoosePractice + runCheckPractice + runFinishPractice). App.tsx keeps
owning every hook, all practice state and the refs; thin wrappers + a
per-render practiceWiringDeps bundle keep all call sites unchanged.

