## TDZ check (APP-SPLIT-003C lesson)

practiceWiringDeps is built after sessionWiringDeps, and is read only
inside the hoisted wrapper functions (openPractice/choosePractice/
checkPractice/finishPractice), which fire from click handlers and
home-wiring session code — never from a mount-time effect. No boot-path
reader exists, so the early-assignment hazard does not apply here; the
bundle sits at the earliest point where every referenced binding
(including sessionWiringDeps) is in scope.

## Test-tree sweep

`grep -rn 'from "./App"'` pins only primitives re-exports
(NO_ACTIVE_PACK, packRequest, …) — untouched by this slice. No test file
references openPractice/choosePractice/checkPractice/finishPractice
(journeys included); the journeys mount <App/> and exercise the practice
runner through the DOM, and all journey suites pass unchanged.
